  "faq": [
    {
      "a": "The purchase stock is the four Fraserview Village strata apartment buildings: Rosewood Court at 22611 116 Avenue, Emerald Manor at 11609 227 Street, The Willows at 11578 225 Street and Castlemount at 11601 227 Street. Confirm the bylaw on the Form B before removing subjects.",
      "gen": "uq",
      "q": "Which Maple Ridge condos can I buy that are 55-plus?"
    },
    {
      "a": "The shared amenity centre at 22610 116 Avenue is the centre of the purchase, described as an indoor pool, hot tub, exercise and recreation centre, clubhouse, workshop and a guest suite residents can rent. A listing for Emerald Manor also stated gas and hot water included in the strata fee and RV parking possible, but those are listing statements, so a buyer should confirm the current fee inclusions in the strata budget and Form B for the specific building.",
      "gen": "uq",
      "q": "What do I get for the strata fee at Fraserview Village?"
    },
    {
      "a": "If a seller uses the name, ask for the strata plan number and civic address and check them against the Land Title record.",
      "gen": "uq",
      "q": "Is there a 55-plus condo called Hillcrest in Maple Ridge?"
    },
    {
      "a": "Two options sit on 224 Street, a short distance west of 116 Avenue: Chartwell Willow at 12275 224 Street offers independent living, assisted living and private long-term care in one building, and Maple Ridge Seniors Village at 22141 119 Avenue offers independent living, assisted living and complex care. Both are rental and care housing, so moving there is a new tenancy, not a transfer of the condo, and Ridge Meadows Hospital is at 11666 Laity Street.",
      "gen": "uq",
      "q": "How close is care if my health changes after I buy at Fraserview?"
    }
  ],
